OL,3,GNEWSA'Booming bass' leads to beach
OL,4,Avenue bother
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusiness owners at a seafront venue
OL,7,Fmade out of upcycled shipping
OL,8,Fcontainers said profits would take a
OL,9,F"huge hit" if events were stopped due
OL,10,Fto noise complaints.
OL,12,FEast Suffolk Council was asked to
OL,13,Fconsider reviewing the premises licence
OL,14,Fof The Arena, an entertainment area
OL,15,Flocated within Beach Street, on Sea
OL,16,FRoad in Felixstowe.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
