OL,3,GNEWSA'Booming bass' leads to beach
OL,4,Avenue bother
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an application made to the
OL,7,Fauthority, neighbouring residents
OL,8,Freported being "subjected to noise
OL,9,Fdisturbance from loud music", with one
OL,10,Fcomplaining to the BBC about "booming
OL,11,Fbass music".
OL,13,FIn a social media statement, Beach
OL,14,FStreet's owners said they "strongly
OL,15,Fchallenge any suggestion" the site had
OL,16,Fbeen a "constant source of late-night
OL,17,Fdisturbance".
